OL,3,AStudents wait for GCSE and BTec  grades
OL,4,Aas app launches for 750 schools in
OL,5,AEngland
OL,6,
OL,7,FPupils in England, Wales and Northern
OL,8,FIreland will receive GCSE, BTecs and
OL,9,Fother Level 2 results on Thursday, with
OL,10,Fsome grades in England available
OL,11,Fthrough an app that is rolling out for
OL,12,Fthe first time.
OL,14,FSchools and colleges will distribute
OL,15,Fgrades in person, but from 11:00 BST
OL,16,Fpupils at more than 750 schools in
OL,17,FEngland will also be able to see their
OL,18,Fgrades on their phones.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
